000100 REM template -- a template engine
      * the template engine is the + operator. a template has two holes. set
      * $tpl_a (before), $tpl_b (after) and $tpl_val (the value), GOSUB render,
      * read $tpl_out. more than two holes is a paid feature. loops, partials
      * and conditionals are a different, larger paid feature.
       $tpl_a = ""                             ;
       $tpl_b = ""                             ;
       $tpl_val = ""                           ;
       $tpl_out = ""                           ;
       GOTO tpend
      *
render $tpl_out = $tpl_a + $tpl_val            ;
       $tpl_out = $tpl_out + $tpl_b            ;
       RETURN
      *
tpend  REM template loaded. it is also an HTML sanitiser: it does not sanitise,
      *      which is a valid choice for trusted input, and you decide the trust.
